{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47213","headline":"灯 · 慕幽","name":"灯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"钟断危楼鸟不飞，荧荧何处最相宜。\n香然水寺僧开卷，笔写春帏客着诗。\n忽尔思多穿壁处，偶然心尽断缨时。\n孙康勤苦谁能念，少减余光借与伊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慕幽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}